    "1_5_001tom_1_5_001_00_4": {
      "revision": "sha256:8a53e85b498eebb1d120e3b23c6fd1c1d5029b26247b1ea42011eee2d18ba7a8",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_001tom_1_5_001_00_4:1_5_001_00_4:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "来る前にカレーを仕込んできたんだ。\n仕事を完璧にこなして、一緒にカレーを食おうぜ！",
        "text": "来之前我已经把咖喱下锅炖好了。\n完美完成工作之后，一起吃咖喱吧！",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c0cd34495bd849642b3da7366e43f1dd6e6c00b5fd4ff5ea3bba2a60311a2d37",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_001tom_1_5_001_00_4:1_5_001_00_4:cmd-000014:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_002sht_1_5_002_02": {
      "revision": "sha256:1bbdf534cdd84516b342c5ddcffaae3d57646f576774bb778520818be13a2297",
      "title": 183,
      "opening": {
        "source": "寝具のCMなんて僕にぴったりじゃない？\nしかもすっごくフワフワでフカフカの枕とお布団！",
        "text": "寝具广告不是超级适合我的吗？\n而且还是超级蓬松又软绵绵的枕头和被子！",
        "source_hash": "sha256:3f5abc1cbded89a5b455b4001075263bf83af4c3ff68c782e4053b8b1765004b",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_002sht_1_5_002_02:1_5_002_02:cmd-000016:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_004ter_1_5_004_00_5": {
      "revision": "sha256:8a860ca53bc7d096513c9362fb7019c9675ce3bb5e6d5e32514219d6c7c0036c",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_004ter_1_5_004_00_5:1_5_004_00_5:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "リハも完璧だったよな。\n本番もこの調子で盛り上げてくるぜ！",
        "text": "彩排也很完美呢。\n正式演出也保持这个状态把气氛炒热吧！",
        "source_hash": "sha256:4d1ab489290d334dd5c532a5cd312af4dcb7009964d08f68e35e4ec27851287b",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_004ter_1_5_004_00_5:1_5_004_00_5:cmd-000015:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_005kao_1_5_005_00_1": {
      "revision": "sha256:b631b6e17c17f510896bbab3154c6a9573a3870fb5aa578f0ad53de5e06e1137",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_005kao_1_5_005_00_1:1_5_005_00_1:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "スケジュールは完璧に頭に入っている。\n次の現場に向かおうか、●●●●プロデューサー。",
        "text": "日程安排已经完全记在脑子里了。\n前往下一个现场吧，●●●●プロデューサー。",
        "source_hash": "sha256:57e7afbe79e2360d354d50c318a4e2ff731a8a45fba32e66875ccca2d72e615a",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_005kao_1_5_005_00_1:1_5_005_00_1:cmd-000015:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_007kei_1_5_007_00_7": {
      "revision": "sha256:2c554dcebe360413ed83cc025609e8c58b1ed471d2d0fc8135a9e8a95de3eab3",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_007kei_1_5_007_00_7:1_5_007_00_7:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "ダンスの練習……大変だけど、やらないわけには\nいかないからね。",
        "text": "练习跳舞……虽然很辛苦，但也不能\n不做呢。",
        "source_hash": "sha256:97304c5cd0cfdb4213c522b983b944535c398c4fc5d4e28138c5d805d746fef7",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_007kei_1_5_007_00_7:1_5_007_00_7:cmd-000016:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_009kyj_1_5_009_00_6": {
      "revision": "sha256:cd93c4753a6d580c5a4ca3f6e5ca68fa5139a5cc470fadff904fee776fbbc47f",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_009kyj_1_5_009_00_6:1_5_009_00_6:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "今日のダンスレッスン、ハードだったな。\nだけどその分、前よりも感覚が掴めたと思う。",
        "text": "今天的舞蹈课挺吃力啊。\n不过也因此，感觉比以前更能抓住感觉了。",
        "source_hash": "sha256:df33f65b1e36b0013d53d8cfa71acc9a5a04ff44579d9f884784d8eeaf65ad8c",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_009kyj_1_5_009_00_6:1_5_009_00_6:cmd-000016:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_009kyj_1_5_009_03": {
      "revision": "sha256:bf40a5a0ff46abc57e291ecd84f94968c7edd71a5dcf416a0fc8f36637a9adcc",
      "title": 212,
      "opening": {
        "source": "携帯電話の最新モデルのCM？",
        "text": "手机最新机型的广告？",
        "source_hash": "sha256:5e8f450ca70be7702dd8161d106f4b6c7eca48721e73cbf760419168c6f55f72",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_009kyj_1_5_009_03:1_5_009_03:cmd-000015:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_010pie_1_5_010_00_6": {
      "revision": "sha256:14439fb8be74ff228d73dc9db5389460fa8bab014ec2db51d785833393cdcb43",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_010pie_1_5_010_00_6:1_5_010_00_6:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "●●●●プロデューサーさん。\nもうちょっとだけ、レッスンしてもいい？",
        "text": "●●●●プロデューサー。\n可以再稍微、上一会儿课吗？",
        "source_hash": "sha256:3ac58b05f54bd91530f031f4a4654b3aecc0f20941e44ab4de27e45d589fdc1c",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_010pie_1_5_010_00_6:1_5_010_00_6:cmd-000017:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_010pie_1_5_010_03": {
      "revision": "sha256:1774bf8258c80d9d487fb6311a7f8d6b31f2322fb08ee14e898e62ef8b6740b4",
      "title": 216,
      "opening": {
        "source": "「へえ、あの子に告白されたんだ？\nよかったね。ずっと好きだって言ってただろ」",
        "text": "“哎，被那个女孩子告白了？\n太好了呢。你不是一直说喜欢她吗”",
        "source_hash": "sha256:3bf2ad36ca08200f946a232c7db2dc6d44ad438468010e100b5d97b6d1e7c874",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_010pie_1_5_010_03:1_5_010_03:cmd-000017:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_012yus_1_5_012_00_3": {
      "revision": "sha256:aff8497b96291e2ddcad2dafec2578c509e6e8336af21b969c740bc87b027f86",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_012yus_1_5_012_00_3:1_5_012_00_3:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "お疲れさま、●●●●●●●●●●監督！\n次、移動だよな！　ほら、早く行こう！",
        "text": "辛苦啦，●●●●●●●●●●监督！\n接下来要转场了对吧！来，快走吧！",
        "source_hash": "sha256:bd7802f185e4ca811fbe01d977533719918f628c60c2e03c24759dbfdb18f138",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_012yus_1_5_012_00_3:1_5_012_00_3:cmd-000017:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_013kys_1_5_013_02": {
      "revision": "sha256:a1eb8f68a07fa064745f07100a4fb163df10a736680150c256da41c9d3da80e6",
      "title": 227,
      "opening": {
        "source": "享介さん、お菓子のCMのお仕事が決まりましたよ！",
        "text": "享介先生，零食广告的工作定下来了哦！",
        "source_hash": "sha256:5690ced99f5fa825b0ea07cf9910793a928e4d90e0d198aa771b5ace118d07e7",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_013kys_1_5_013_02:1_5_013_02:cmd-000014:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_016sei_1_5_016_02": {
      "revision": "sha256:4badfcbadfa6937c8492c5959c0a50d44ffaff226c9c6e559fcd86cd5d162e7a",
      "title": 239,
      "opening": {
        "source": "誠司さん、準備は大丈夫ですか？",
        "text": "诚司先生，准备好了吗？",
        "source_hash": "sha256:e11f834c8bb528113ff64f58f7c2d5bbba3e0bf822b52c2aca0f23c3d70f0429",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_016sei_1_5_016_02:1_5_016_02:cmd-000014:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_019kur_1_5_019_00_4": {
      "revision": "sha256:3eaca85f5171ed8b1b8baa74b160dc52fa2cf3790799109ad63361580282a776",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_019kur_1_5_019_00_4:1_5_019_00_4:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "念のため、本番前にもう一度、\n段取りを確認しておきましょう。",
        "text": "为以防万一，在正式上场前\n我们再确认一次流程吧。",
        "source_hash": "sha256:0ed22a6c47931d08e738a93f62d249746d0d99354388b1373996e2dd0e8a57bd",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_019kur_1_5_019_00_4:1_5_019_00_4:cmd-000014:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_021jun_1_5_021_00_1": {
      "revision": "sha256:025a3b6df3966eb80d0126e1ed81789d6f23f28bb0c1b0b48a4cbf97a88959ec",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_021jun_1_5_021_00_1:1_5_021_00_1:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "収録が上手くいってよかったです。\n練習の成果を出せたと思います。",
        "text": "录制进行得很顺利，真是太好了。\n我想我已经发挥出平时的练习成果了。",
        "source_hash": "sha256:ba53a4858e1a861bec862aceb6d29272984f18b7d56db98afe9b4ed67a8e4d7f",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_021jun_1_5_021_00_1:1_5_021_00_1:cmd-000017:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_023har_1_5_023_00_3": {
      "revision": "sha256:7baa86907300a65090f60750823d73fb34fb5a5b0cb438ee2f085a1149467d48",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_023har_1_5_023_00_3:1_5_023_00_3:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "飲み物買ってきたから、\n●●●●プロデューサーも一緒に休憩しようぜ。",
        "text": "饮料买回来了，\n●●●●プロデューサー也一起来休息一下吧。",
        "source_hash": "sha256:f9c0ff9dd80fc43fc72a5e15a7c628aedcfad4b777e93108dc5b9dbd8bb50283",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_023har_1_5_023_00_3:1_5_023_00_3:cmd-000015:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_025suz_1_5_025_00_6": {
      "revision": "sha256:2d9afbcbf15b6eb373ac7681fe123b7ed9005cb7c46ab997d4505d99ad0391e2",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_025suz_1_5_025_00_6:1_5_025_00_6:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "仕事が終わったら、玄武がパンケーキ食いに\n付き合ってくれるんだぜ！　ヘヘッ。",
        "text": "等工作结束之后，玄武会陪我去\n吃松饼呢！嘿嘿。",
        "source_hash": "sha256:d84ac1ff434d8c898811543401db076a6aedcb4d26146a0ead97d00c38160a29",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_025suz_1_5_025_00_6:1_5_025_00_6:cmd-000015:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_025suz_1_5_025_03": {
      "revision": "sha256:9589cfbf3430165d54c8cf93ab8007aa93feadb69fd1831071c789ed9d125e7c",
      "title": 276,
      "opening": {
        "source": "はあああ……。つ、疲れた……。\nもう立てねぇ……。",
        "text": "哈啊啊啊……累、累死了……\n已经站不起来了……",
        "source_hash": "sha256:ed58116b74e0077dd1477318487a312bf6b67386aaa482082e8d24c5e8621702",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_025suz_1_5_025_03:1_5_025_03:cmd-000016:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_026gen_1_5_026_00_0": {
      "revision": "sha256:15a5810cc5624812066289e714508a5bb1b12689c610356e3a7013cd7a0bff4a",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_026gen_1_5_026_00_0:1_5_026_00_0:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "さっきの仕事で、朱雀が服を汚しやがった。\n……いや、大丈夫だ。染み抜きなら俺に任せてくれ。",
        "text": "刚才的工作里，朱雀把衣服弄脏了。\n……不，没关系。去污渍的事情就交给我吧。",
        "source_hash": "sha256:ed9d597497bb23adba9dda9fa00f6b84bd12df8a11c9e5aa7c52c4289b4e97fb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_026gen_1_5_026_00_0:1_5_026_00_0:cmd-000018:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_027yuk_1_5_027_00_3": {
      "revision": "sha256:1c0ba015b77aed76d6cfc841084ae1beee6540112cbe158cff8f72956bb6edae",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_027yuk_1_5_027_00_3:1_5_027_00_3:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "高校を卒業したあとは、各国を回っていたよ。\n仕事でもいろんなところに行ってみたいな。",
        "text": "高中毕业后，我环游了各国。\n借着工作的机会，也想去各种各样的地方走走呢。",
        "source_hash": "sha256:0c35be1dd41d0dd141013626d8c6460f58d7a56e63dbd7c1e8241d2d3454839b",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_027yuk_1_5_027_00_3:1_5_027_00_3:cmd-000015:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_028soi_1_5_028_00_3": {
      "revision": "sha256:754e057d3a2c5027eabdbf5efb35fe78f11e0fcbefb20359c645903c1d69e34e",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_028soi_1_5_028_00_3:1_5_028_00_3:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "次の仕事までに、もう少し体力をつけたいですね。\nトレーニングに付き合っていただけますか？",
        "text": "在下一份工作之前，真想再多储备些体力呢。\n可以陪我一起锻炼吗？",
        "source_hash": "sha256:bc2de6a32c7211022b4817d2573c4d6e2fb47a83857afc7f2aab3a635c6f1d0e",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_028soi_1_5_028_00_3:1_5_028_00_3:cmd-000016:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_029ass_1_5_029_00_5": {
      "revision": "sha256:b59402b718b146441d27a523feaee1089293c4d109e18b9f07ca65ec90fe91ea",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_029ass_1_5_029_00_5:1_5_029_00_5:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "我が同胞団は戦友にして盟友。\nこれからも、共に覇道を歩もうぞ！",
        "text": "本座的同胞团既是战友，亦是盟友。\n今后，也一同迈向霸道吧！",
        "source_hash": "sha256:0c5b8f63e944b229c9756d37f3015f24effb9b169e132509e77658b2a5e0315e",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_029ass_1_5_029_00_5:1_5_029_00_5:cmd-000017:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_030mak_1_5_030_00_7": {
      "revision": "sha256:b48ee60c9f962e1ff97fbcfcf408fcb18451f1cd998d025b0b351c85b195ff8f",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_030mak_1_5_030_00_7:1_5_030_00_7:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "俺、利きケーキが得意なんです。ケーキを当てる\nお仕事があったら、全問正解する自信があります！",
        "text": "我很擅长盲品蛋糕呢。要是有猜蛋糕的\n工作，我有信心能全部答对！",
        "source_hash": "sha256:7ecb27feaac8a0f5ed6d873b82a522cac5a2a60cdf9160d7592aa41faf3e7373",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_030mak_1_5_030_00_7:1_5_030_00_7:cmd-000014:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_031sak_1_5_031_00_7": {
      "revision": "sha256:ed8b58b91902cfee84b992b27ee23189f92249a91271593a954faa253dd279af",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_031sak_1_5_031_00_7:1_5_031_00_7:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "この前の仕事で手品を披露したら、\nすっごく盛り上がったんだー！",
        "text": "上次工作的时候表演了魔术，\n现场气氛超级热烈呢——！",
        "source_hash": "sha256:8f73b9a12912d7ed2a556c1b80d66899b3d9f169d13192bfa0b3d45d1ad24a5b",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_031sak_1_5_031_00_7:1_5_031_00_7:cmd-000015:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_034kan_1_5_034_00_6": {
      "revision": "sha256:59a32a20e898406d3d2420adf57d71cf058c2ffc05e8cb1a80f0364a25b2018e",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_034kan_1_5_034_00_6:1_5_034_00_6:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "●●●●プロデューサーさんがいるから\nいつもよりダンスのレッスンがんばれちゃうかも♪",
        "text": "因为有●●●●プロデューサー在，\n跳舞练习说不定能比平时更努力呢♪",
        "source_hash": "sha256:2e9cb53f9ee02c6a101c4c754ec55a3cdaf6f6a5c88cae744b4a647327a957f6",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_034kan_1_5_034_00_6:1_5_034_00_6:cmd-000016:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_034kan_1_5_034_03": {
      "revision": "sha256:af97bb3bb4bab40d91821290904fa7a9674b6a6b7ad57ebd9d0b73d1ec4cbca5",
      "title": 312,
      "opening": {
        "source": "ふふ、今日はいろんなキャラクターに会えるから\nとっても楽しみにしてたの♪",
        "text": "呵呵，今天能见到各种各样的吉祥物，\n花音超级期待的♪",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c2a15df818e09dd63cc3eb4ea1fc13ebd90335c71bc8558b487c9c00bd533b9c",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_034kan_1_5_034_03:1_5_034_03:cmd-000017:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_035mco_1_5_035_00_3": {
      "revision": "sha256:c6eac1a49c89883eb240d50e4f0cd4f2970b4499e304534f484c55f1e0006058",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_035mco_1_5_035_00_3:1_5_035_00_3:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "オフの日は体をきちんと休めることはもちろん、\n息抜きをすることも大事だ。",
        "text": "休息日不仅要好好放松身体，\n适度转换心情也很重要。",
        "source_hash": "sha256:d1c160686ee7a9f61bd4c1936487f1faca2d9e59574f7821033c601e43a85e7e",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_035mco_1_5_035_00_3:1_5_035_00_3:cmd-000013:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_036rui_1_5_036_00_8": {
      "revision": "sha256:a8cf0c7a76bfbcadc81ce101f5d73d0cda262bd8356b2cda90ff7cda65e7fffe",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "开始工作",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_036rui_1_5_036_00_8:1_5_036_00_8:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "●●●●プロデューサーちゃん、\nいつもso funな仕事ありがとう！",
        "text": "●●●●プロデューサー酱，\n一直以来都谢谢你安排这么so fun的工作！",
        "source_hash": "sha256:46fcb4e0e4f094f4981a7106e08bc34edbf414c43a59bd03ff387f9efa627845",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_036rui_1_5_036_00_8:1_5_036_00_8:cmd-000016:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_036rui_1_5_036_01": {
      "revision": "sha256:3ff751b38e9717e7514e2ea630e4b5c44a2b905ea1390892f4fe20c445e205c2",
      "title": 318,
      "opening": {
        "source": "「そんなに難しく考えなくても、\nNo problem！　俺とtalkしよう」",
        "text": "“不用想得那么难，\nNo problem！和我来talk吧”",
        "source_hash": "sha256:5a86a6b3c87eba1adc15b675ceefe042b7f0c055e53889402d236bc75d0848fd",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_036rui_1_5_036_01:1_5_036_01:cmd-000019:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_037jir_1_5_037_02": {
      "revision": "sha256:e9014ec7fc0c9cb5e6f3cbba83f0e99a169c4a488e7c5c64c58c7b1086b64fa7",
      "title": 323,
      "opening": {
        "source": "次郎さん、競馬のCMの仕事が決まりました！",
        "text": "次郎先生，出演赛马广告的工作定下来了！",
        "source_hash": "sha256:bbe98da8f922c1a49cc0335ab0fe29133480c4f10fc6f432066aecd5ebedf9b8",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_037jir_1_5_037_02:1_5_037_02:cmd-000014:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_039mcr_1_5_039_00_8": {
      "revision": "sha256:db2893e3d96c0aa94841dc7cff2b5559f1b6c5bfbcd993921886838ce830b6c5",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "工作开始",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_039mcr_1_5_039_00_8:1_5_039_00_8:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "●●●●●●●●●●師匠も一緒に走るッスか？\n体を動かすのは気持ちいいッスよ！",
        "text": "●●●●●●●●●●师父也一起来跑步吗？\n活动活动筋骨感觉很舒服的哦！",
        "source_hash": "sha256:359c4782491791e9b3b9f458b99a16d60c9658a8451f9ce04f359a7384860e9a",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_039mcr_1_5_039_00_8:1_5_039_00_8:cmd-000015:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_039mcr_1_5_039_01": {
      "revision": "sha256:afade4aeb4972591eedb527dd5b1d99b1d0e3c93468dc03a5cf8c964eb449597",
      "title": 330,
      "opening": {
        "source": "はい、前に話したうさぎのあみぐるみ。\n自分からのプレゼントだ！",
        "text": "给，这是之前说过的毛线兔子玩偶。\n是我送你的礼物！",
        "source_hash": "sha256:4f60a38bf6fc9ac271534f4e7742f74e92f707f7ef75e41cc4a3226f393d8581",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_039mcr_1_5_039_01:1_5_039_01:cmd-000015:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_042dai_1_5_042_00_4": {
      "revision": "sha256:bfb21c779dbe1e55fa1e1ae70e016299dad1d9dea006f37ef4ae1155f0e37658",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "工作开始",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_042dai_1_5_042_00_4:1_5_042_00_4:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "●●●●●●●●●●ボス、本番まで時間が\nできたんじゃろ？　ワシとゲームで一勝負せんか？",
        "text": "●●●●●●●●●●Boss，离正式开始还有点\n空闲时间对吧？要不要跟俺来局游戏对决？",
        "source_hash": "sha256:220d5c8ef2afb4b7c6a3a909f24950ca8c87ccbc6fbf370a86087b784699955f",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_042dai_1_5_042_00_4:1_5_042_00_4:cmd-000016:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_044ame_1_5_044_00_3": {
      "revision": "sha256:c10b996c225d533a732f5beeb32e283abd06775b8c9934f32aca27fe9deb8fb5",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "工作开始",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_044ame_1_5_044_00_3:1_5_044_00_3:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "この歓声は俺たちに向けられているのか。\nありがたい話だ。",
        "text": "这片欢呼声是送给我们的吗。\n真是令人欣慰的事情。",
        "source_hash": "sha256:f32057c170ee399d19182824db9e872975109bcfd14b289fe1710755e0909da4",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_044ame_1_5_044_00_3:1_5_044_00_3:cmd-000018:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_045sor_1_5_045_00_0": {
      "revision": "sha256:a66798ce0507abfa5298e5d417952e4233b3e387c1dded55ea035b218b18cb43",
      "record": {
        "source": "お仕事開始",
        "text": "工作开始",
        "source_hash": "sha256:c9578f41f04512f8dd518c9243e386d3dec69c30c8930a99faa1eaef07ea0ceb",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_045sor_1_5_045_00_0:1_5_045_00_0:cmd-000000:title:000"
      },
      "opening": {
        "source": "お疲れさまでしたー。収録押しちゃったけど、\n無事に終わってよかったねー。",
        "text": "辛苦了～虽然录制超时了，\n不过能顺利结束真是太好了呢～",
        "source_hash": "sha256:f55d582c410078454180ce73251d141d7ce6c7e31ef5c27783e3f5aa2b389cee",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_045sor_1_5_045_00_0:1_5_045_00_0:cmd-000016:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_048mom_1_5_048_04": {
      "revision": "sha256:f96c5237291b0fb54532076a33bb4eabaa6a5c4f0c31c1ef8ff7aa9fe8a7f8f0",
      "title": 369,
      "opening": {
        "source": "●●●●●●●●●●ぴぃちゃん。\n書類、揃え終わったよ。",
        "text": "●●●●●●●●●●P酱。\n文件，我都整理好咯。",
        "source_hash": "sha256:2078d86dea0b0b609316c7eab6d7d28c22c2a58a9f5bed5919e04618403c2a75",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_048mom_1_5_048_04:1_5_048_04:cmd-000017:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
    "1_5_049eis_1_5_049_02": {
      "revision": "sha256:9e08dde34162f882ff283dfab957b394f1580ac3f7c4bb264a9cd8a7ca294253",
      "title": 371,
      "opening": {
        "source": "なるほど、2階からもステージが見える構造か。",
        "text": "原来如此，是从2楼也能看到舞台的构造啊。",
        "source_hash": "sha256:383fdee893aac9878ecb181a74f74d3743afcb38ed1c84f9d2512890a860f639",
        "unit_id": "story-text:v1:1_5_049eis_1_5_049_02:1_5_049_02:cmd-000019:dialogue:000"
      }
    },
